      "instance_name": "child_receiving_instruction",
      "label": "African child receiving medical instruction",
      "description": "The scene depicts an African child, who is the central visual focus, looking directly at the camera with a somber, distressed expression. The child is positioned in the foreground, and the text overlay implies an interaction with a doctor who is giving instructions. The child's tear and expression suggest emotional distress or confusion, creating a scene of implied instruction or confrontation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
